      "canonical_latex": "E_k = \\alpha + 2\\beta\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi k}{N}\\right)\\quad (k = 0, 1, \\dots, N-1),\\qquad N_{\\pi,\\text{closed}} = 4n + 2\\;(n \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{\\ge 0})",
